{"name": "ZERO_FILL", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bring everything to zero in ZERO_FILL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on a square to reduce or increase\u00a0its value, but be careful: it also affects its neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/51771470c87891fca9d744fc88ab4d99.avif?t=1772820014\" width=\"583\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/c0fff0abb25301f05aa7f92a97b7e059.poster.avif?t=1772820014\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/c0fff0abb25301f05aa7f92a97b7e059.webm?t=1772820014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/c0fff0abb25301f05aa7f92a97b7e059.mp4?t=1772820014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself in the <strong>Campaign</strong> across <strong>75 handcrafted boards</strong> of increasing complexity. Plan each move, chain reactions, and empty out every grid! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember: you have a limited amount of <strong>moves </strong>per board: <strong>undo</strong> and\u00a0<strong>reset</strong> are your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/dad1557969abae28be555562e3e3342b.poster.avif?t=1772820014\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/dad1557969abae28be555562e3e3342b.webm?t=1772820014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/dad1557969abae28be555562e3e3342b.mp4?t=1772820014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Infinite gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own boards via the <strong>Creation Center</strong>, <strong>share</strong> them, and play other players' boards via <strong>Share Codes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And when you're finished with the campaign, play as much as you want with the <strong>Random Boards Generator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/15ea494cf2ba480050873468d3e4a8ac.poster.avif?t=1772820014\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/15ea494cf2ba480050873468d3e4a8ac.webm?t=1772820014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/extras/15ea494cf2ba480050873468d3e4a8ac.mp4?t=1772820014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you zero them all out?</strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "ZERO_FILL is a minimalist logic puzzle game. Bring all numbers to zero: click on a square to reduce or increase\u00a0its value, but be careful - it also affects its neighbors. Includes a campaign with 75 boards, a boards creator and infinite random boards generation.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389600/b042eadfe10a7b3dd60d6790b696b0cf149389fa/header.jpg?t=1772820014", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Logic", "Difficult", "Relaxing", "Minimalist", "Choices Matter"], "developers": "Catoio Software", "publishers": "Catoio Software", "release_date": "Mar 6, 2026", "price": "$0.99", "appid": "4389600", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/GveGE0AvccY", "first_seen": 1771455600.0, "review_rank": 1177}